From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tabs3-linux maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: gts3llte: enable MSS for diagnostics

The production SM-T825 DT keeps the modem DSP disabled until its own modem
firmware, rmtfs and recovery path have been checked.  This patch is deliberately
named .patch.disabled so the normal APKBUILD never applies it.  Set
T825_MSS_DIAGNOSTIC=1 when building a private test kernel; the device package
must also contain the matching modem firmware and GNSS userspace services.

---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996-samsung-gts3llte.dts | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996-samsung-gts3llte.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996-samsung-gts3llte.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996-samsung-gts3llte.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996-samsung-gts3llte.dts
@@ -44,7 +44,7 @@
 };
 
 &mss_pil {
-	status = "disabled";
+	status = "okay";
 };
 
 &tlmm {
-- 
2.50.0
